{"title":"1976 USAMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the sum of the lengths of the six edges of a trirectangular tetrahedron <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/1/f7171346ba14a05722c3b2a0954f59407eec9ff7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PABC$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> (i.e., <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/b/a4bd3fcb139562b5962f60f453c580bef7e0fc52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle APB=\\angle BPC=\\angle CPA=90^o$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"266\" height=\"14\" />) is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, determine its maximum volume.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the side lengths of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/b/e3bb4eeb347e74e025fd175c22f1f7275af0555e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/7/f874b39870586f0504f50a667f2bafedddf47904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/3/d13fd509f3062449aaea6e10e1040b1d585063f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CP$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, respectively. Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/9/379890e60e87a9e1a8aed92e2c9ae9aa27d15258.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S=a+b+c+\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}+\\sqrt{b^2+c^2}+\\sqrt{c^2+a^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"380\" height=\"18\" />. Let the volume of the tetrahedron be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/d/12d58aa29201da09d8e620f8698e3a37547f6b4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$V$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/0/71003cb6a87683c3c1a02b3c813fc17b7a2c9d13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$V=\\frac{abc}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"66\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/4/7c49e9a65af72ebb5960be695c6d6130e859e3dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-b)^2\\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"19\" /> implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/1/eb112cc44832d733bdbdc33a82edcfe18e053781.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a^2-2ab+b^2}{2}\\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"140\" height=\"39\" />, which means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38c766fafc8783c160f365e3136afaa0d4b552b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a^2+b^2}{2}\\geq ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"100\" height=\"39\" />, which implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/d/81df74a694f6d79988935647ac7154f3a9e7c483.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b^2\\geq ab+\\frac{a^2+b^2}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"175\" height=\"39\" />, which means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/3/9e39f9388a2433327acd7b240390acfce6332c0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2+b^2\\geq \\frac{(a+b)^2}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"142\" height=\"39\" />, which implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/1/1e14db7257654c1734678dab8ea546cf3e682459.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}\\geq \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\cdot (a+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"187\" height=\"41\" />. Equality holds only when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5abd2c942ae299fd26e18d0ca5d390a7ca4a8c34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />. Therefore\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/6/a9626a51e9afd47db3dccedd295beef761ed201f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S\\geq a+b+c+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\cdot (a+b)+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\cdot (c+b)+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\cdot (a+c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"458\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/f/2af06de9d7cd5b7878eb40e4998743c4c073544d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=(a+b+c)(1+\\sqrt{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"171\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/0/750fc0d145398219c81ee8aa1f8138c51f599ce4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a+b+c}{3}\\geq \\sqrt[3]{abc}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"139\" height=\"37\" /> is true from AM-GM, with equality only when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/6/566b9136144a62fac113ecbc8065793a74123238.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b=c$\" width=\"74\" height=\"12\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/8/848e07b7c56a5da113a55eb1bf45b4a43617e3b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S\\geq (a+b+c)(1+\\sqrt{2})\\geq 3(1+\\sqrt{2})\\sqrt[3]{abc}=3(1+\\sqrt{2})\\sqrt[3]{6V}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"478\" height=\"24\" />. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/f/b0fd0fcd72820142e0afb2c7928813b9b720d4d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{S}{3(1+\\sqrt{2})}=\\frac{S(\\sqrt{2}-1)}{3}\\geq \\sqrt[3]{6V}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"257\" height=\"47\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/f/81f1c4f665b8096994645da5f6aff58425dfe7fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6V\\leq \\frac{S^3(\\sqrt{2}-1)^3}{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"147\" height=\"41\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f3776602cc9aea49579e7998021b9873f8e6acf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$V\\leq \\frac{S^3(\\sqrt{2}-1)^3}{162}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"138\" height=\"41\" />, with equality only when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/6/566b9136144a62fac113ecbc8065793a74123238.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b=c$\" width=\"74\" height=\"12\" />. Therefore the maximum volume is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/8/68864826f9248cda860b9d088741fe241367219a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{S^3(\\sqrt{2}-1)^3}{162}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"99\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that by AM-GM <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/2/6826d56cf2c6144cda0a62e6414be36dbd24a81a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S = a + b + c + \\sqrt{a^2 + b^2} + \\sqrt{b^2 + c^2} + \\sqrt{a^2 + c^2} \\ge 3\\sqrt[3]{abc} + \\sqrt{2ab} + \\sqrt{2bc} + \\sqrt{2ac} \\ge 3\\sqrt[3]{abc} + 3\\sqrt{2}\\sqrt[3]{abc},\\]\" width=\"746\" height=\"21\" />\nso <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/d/2bd8161f116d4d510a3602a8cee6d317f6193040.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt[3]{abc} \\le \\frac{S}{3 + 3\\sqrt{2}} = \\frac{S}{3} \\cdot (\\sqrt{2} - 1).\\]\" width=\"259\" height=\"41\" /> Proceed as before.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n<i>Alternate solutions are always welcome. If you have a different, elegant solution to this problem, please <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1976_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit\">add it</a> to this page.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_USAMO\" title=\"1976 USAMO\">1976 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"1976 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=1976\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1976 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1976 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1976 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1976 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1976 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1976 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017172302\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.196 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 207/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1617/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6076/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   18.476      1 -total\n 38.34%    7.083      1 Template:USAMO_box\n 32.03%    5.917      1 Template:Alternate_solutions\n 27.99%    5.172      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:7567:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017172302 and revision id 79477. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}